      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "装配链",
      "items": [
        "AssemblyInterface 按 DependsOn 拓扑排序装配",
        "Env → Config → Logger → Database → Redis → Cache",
        "未安装时 Redis 为 nil、缓存退化为 memory"
      ]
